    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend portals from hordes of slimes with elemental foxes from a tabletop VR perspective. Recruit a colorful set of characters to help in your quest to reconnect a fragmented world over a 25 level single-player story adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/bdc5ee49b55730549083b08f9e423e01.poster.avif?t=1750698015\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/bdc5ee49b55730549083b08f9e423e01.webm?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/bdc5ee49b55730549083b08f9e423e01.mp4?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No fixed paths.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes can climb anything, but they (usually) don't like to. You must know your enemy to build your defenses effectively. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/7f521196667d8ea20bc137aeeaf29a14.poster.avif?t=1750698015\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/7f521196667d8ea20bc137aeeaf29a14.webm?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/7f521196667d8ea20bc137aeeaf29a14.mp4?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Upgrades. No  Numbers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placement is everything. Each level grants limited portal uses to bring items from your collection, and it's up to you to decide what to bring and where to put it. Every fox and item interacts differently with the game world, and you'll need to experiment to learn how to use them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/f02452ce607a76fb92a4bb5c716fba55.poster.avif?t=1750698015\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/f02452ce607a76fb92a4bb5c716fba55.webm?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/f02452ce607a76fb92a4bb5c716fba55.mp4?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Problem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal Foxes TD uses simple intuitive 3D cursors. It can be played seated or standing, and all game elements can be moved and resized for maximum comfort. It can be played primarily right or left handed. It is unlikely to cause motion sickness and never requires fast physical movements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thanks for your support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy VR tabletop strategy games, then please download the demo and see if you can solve the puzzles and defend your portal.\u00a0 Scroll up and download the demo, and start playing right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out my game!\u00a0 Hope you have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend portals from hordes of slimes with elemental foxes from a tabletop VR perspective. Recruit a colorful set of characters to help in your quest to reconnect a fragmented world over a 25 level single-player story adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/bdc5ee49b55730549083b08f9e423e01.poster.avif?t=1750698015\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/bdc5ee49b55730549083b08f9e423e01.webm?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/bdc5ee49b55730549083b08f9e423e01.mp4?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No fixed paths.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes can climb anything, but they (usually) don't like to. You must know your enemy to build your defenses effectively. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/7f521196667d8ea20bc137aeeaf29a14.poster.avif?t=1750698015\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/7f521196667d8ea20bc137aeeaf29a14.webm?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/7f521196667d8ea20bc137aeeaf29a14.mp4?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Upgrades. No  Numbers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placement is everything. Each level grants limited portal uses to bring items from your collection, and it's up to you to decide what to bring and where to put it. Every fox and item interacts differently with the game world, and you'll need to experiment to learn how to use them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/f02452ce607a76fb92a4bb5c716fba55.poster.avif?t=1750698015\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/f02452ce607a76fb92a4bb5c716fba55.webm?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485250/extras/f02452ce607a76fb92a4bb5c716fba55.mp4?t=1750698015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Problem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal Foxes TD uses simple intuitive 3D cursors. It can be played seated or standing, and all game elements can be moved and resized for maximum comfort. It can be played primarily right or left handed. It is unlikely to cause motion sickness and never requires fast physical movements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thanks for your support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy VR tabletop strategy games, then please download the demo and see if you can solve the puzzles and defend your portal.\u00a0 Scroll up and download the demo, and start playing right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out my game!\u00a0 Hope you have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Defend portals from hordes of slimes with elemental foxes in this tabletop VR game. Build mazes to thwart adaptive enemy pathing in three dimensions. Collect a variety of foxes and equipment over a 25 level story campaign.",
